9816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.2 Theorem 1.2.3(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"18"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>39</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A^2\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>；单关系ARS见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li>半完备、归约归纳性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"24ab7835d52d9508\" href=\"?note=24ab7835d52d9508\" title=\"56-df-semi-complete\">56-df-semi-complete</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"88a9a11cf6ba5c17\" href=\"?note=88a9a11cf6ba5c17\" title=\"56-df-inductive\">56-df-inductive</a>；所用合流与正规形性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f4c4c74c238d39f8\" href=\"?note=f4c4c74c238d39f8\" title=\"56-thm-wn-un-confluence\">56-thm-wn-un-confluence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"84b767b970cfd3a0\" href=\"?note=84b767b970cfd3a0\" title=\"56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form\">56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SemiComplete}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Inductive}(A,\\to).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SemiComplete}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Inductive}(A,\\to).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书陈述已核对，证明已复核：半完备给合流与正规形性质。选起点的一条归约到正规形n；序列中每项与起点可转换，故每项都归约到同一个n，满足共同后继条件。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-semi-complete","status":"resolved","id":"24ab7835d52d9508","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-semi-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-inductive","status":"resolved","id":"88a9a11cf6ba5c17","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-inductive]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-wn-un-confluence","status":"resolved","id":"f4c4c74c238d39f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-wn-un-confluence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"84b767b970cfd3a0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\to\\subseteq A^2$；单关系ARS见 [[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-semi-complete","status":"resolved","id":"24ab7835d52d9508","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"半完备、归约归纳性见 [[56-df-semi-complete]]、[[56-df-inductive]]；所用合流与正规形性质见 [[56-thm-wn-un-confluence]]、[[56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-inductive","status":"resolved","i